comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T04:05:38.030Z",codex-agent,"Round 1: issue read in full; searched existing tracker and no issue-specific import exists. Implement in fix/import-and-release-issues from origin/main; add behavioral revert proof and run unchanged npm and Bun release gates with isolated CI identity."
  "2026-10-18T04:09:09.240Z",codex-agent,"Validate each effective rule type as a nonempty string before accepting it as unrelated policy. New real-tracker matrix reproduces unsafe closure for missing/null/numeric/object/empty types and a hidden required-check row, in both readable-empty and declared-policy modes: baseline fails 12/12. Fixed refusals must retain byte-identical durable tracker state; valid deletion rules retain fallback."
  "2026-10-18T04:09:56.876Z",codex-agent,"Isolated revert proof: restore only closeout.ts to origin/main with all new tests retained; the missing-type/readable-empty regression fails because closed=1. Restore the fix: all 12 malformed discriminator cases refuse with byte-identical durable files and the unrelated-rule control passes. Combined real-tracker acceptance passes 23/23, zero skips."
  "2026-10-18T04:57:10.354Z",codex-agent,"Issue #141: 13/13 real-SDK policy fixtures pass with zero durable writes on all 12 malformed refusals; the isolated closeout.ts revert fails 1/1. Both full CI release commands PASS at 956ae58201a9058f19fab2ca6e265b7426374639: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each pass 824/824, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage across 14 authored modules. Isolated HOME and global/system Git identity were enforced. Receipts: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39098074518/job/117588542763 and https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/actions/runs/39098074518/job/117588542909 . Remove the temporary validation workflow; implementation/tests remain unchanged. Regenerate the changelog after ALL final tracker writes. Item remains in progress and unclaimed for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-18T06:51:49.425Z",codex-agent,"PR #148 follow-up after merging current main: no unresolved review threads or substantive CodeRabbit review are present. Existing implementation and behavioral revert proofs are unchanged. Re-run this item's linked real regression command and collect both exact isolated npm/Bun release receipts; retain Fixes links and leave closure to the orchestrator."
  "2026-10-18T06:58:50.345Z",codex-agent,"PR #148 integration validation: the linked malformed-rule and valid-unrelated-rule command passes 13/13. Exact npm run release:check and bun run release:check both pass 836/836 at 762285d94e90e645927b90e8032292c191772b49, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos, all 14 authored modules at exact 100/100/100/100. Existing behavioral revert proof and implementation remain unchanged. Fresh-clone strict health passes. Full gate receipts: actions/runs/39105101037. No CodeRabbit review is available yet; final CI will be recorded in the PR body."
